Manage configured devices

Usage:
  tickerbox device [command]

Available Commands:
  add         Add or replace a configured device
  discover    Find TickerBoxes on the local network
  list        List configured devices
  ping        Check reachability of one or all configured devices
  rm          Remove a configured device
  use         Set the default device

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for device

Global Flags:
  -d, --device string      named device from the config file
      --host string        TickerBox base URL (default http://tickerbox.local, or $TICKERBOX_HOST)
  -j, --json               emit raw device JSON instead of a decoded table
      --retry int          retry an idempotent request this many times on a transient failure (default 2)
      --timeout duration   per-request timeout (default 10s)

Use "tickerbox device [command] --help" for more information about a command.
